  "builder": "inventory_runs.e7_designs (seed 20261203), redate (G-a) per draw. The caller's context for each set: inventory_runs.Context.from_files(0.02) for the headline set and inventory_runs.Context.from_files(0.02, which=\"every_cohort_utility\") for every cohort utility, which gives that set no set-aside list, as design.split does (inventory_runs.aside_for); the roster is the set's own hosts from RunInputs.sets. E7's quantity-side summary for the headline set and for every cohort utility is written by inventory_runs.main to data/frozen/inventory_run_designs.json, blocks E7 and E7_every_cohort_utility, at the specified 200 draws a direction under seed 20261203. For every cohort utility the primary reporting denominator of those quantity-side shares is the 36 hosts of the set's reference design, with the roster of 41 reported beside it (Joe, 2026-11-20, D-117), by presentation only with nothing redrawn: e7_presentation.denominators reads the stored block E7_every_cohort_utility, and data/frozen/e7_reporting_denominator.json holds both figures",
